STARTFONT 2.1
FONT -Sinclair-SinclairNarrow-Medium-R-Normal--8-80-75-75-C-480-ISO8859-1
SIZE 8 75 75
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 6 8 0 -2
COMMENT "Sinclair Narrow -- a 6x8 face derived from the ZX Spectrum 48K character set"
COMMENT "Derived on 2026-11-20 07:38:03"
COMMENT "Base glyphs: each 8-wide ROM cell loses its far-right column (7), then its fourth-from-left (3)"
COMMENT "Kept original columns 0,1,2,4,5,6, packed MSB-first"
COMMENT "Lowercase a-z are right-aligned to the cell's right edge (column 5)"
COMMENT "Hand-redrawn glyphs (most from the Sinclair Narrow design): ! ' * + , / 0 7 < > I : ; Q T V Y [ \ ] ^ f i k l m t v w x z ~ ) } (c)"
STARTPROPERTIES 7
FOUNDRY "Sinclair"
FAMILY_NAME "Sinclair Narrow"
WEIGHT_NAME "Medium"
SLANT "R"
SETWIDTH_NAME "Normal"
PIXEL_SIZE 8
POINT_SIZE 80
ENDPROPERTIES
